1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,015
Now the needle.

2
00:00:01,015 --> 00:00:04,570
Seen end on, it sits in a little dent in the surface.

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:11,927
The surface pulls along itself on both sides, and because the dent is tilted, each pull has an upward part.

4
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:14,960
Together they hold up the needle's small weight.

5
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,135
The ship floats by upthrust.

6
00:00:17,135 --> 00:00:20,039
The needle floats by surface tension.

